{#
    "From X €/mo. for your whole cart" — hooked into
    `sylius_shop.cart.index.content.form.sections.general.summary`, which receives
    `cart` as context (see @SyliusShop/cart/index/content/form/sections/general/summary.html.twig).

    `mode="cart"` is required — without it the element's own `observedAttributes`
    (`reference`, `mode`) never resolve a rendering mode and it silently stays empty
    (0x0, no shadow content) even though `window.topi.cartItems` is populated
    correctly. Confirmed live: `customElements.get('x-topi-cart-rental-summary-label').observedAttributes`
    → `['reference', 'mode']`; setting `mode="cart"` on an already-rendered element
    makes it render immediately without any other change.
#}
{% import '@EilingIoSyliusTopiPlugin/shop/topi_elements/_macros.html.twig' as topi %}
{% set cart = hookable_metadata.context.cart %}
{% if cart is not null %}
    <x-topi-cart-rental-summary-label mode="cart"></x-topi-cart-rental-summary-label>
    {{ topi.cart_item_carriers(cart.items) }}
{% endif %}
